    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, but it feels like there's a big difference in the energy of the two sides. Like, the voucher side talks about \"freedom\" and \"opportunity,\" which sounds pretty positive. But the other side just seems to be focused on blocking change or protecting the status quo. Is it fair to say the opposition is more about protecting existing systems than actually helping kids?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
